			<content>
				<p fontFamily="造字工房悦圆 G0v1 常规体" fontSize="30" color="#ffffff">元素能量：WP[0]</p>
			</content>
			<filters>
				<DropShadowFilter angle="40" color="#eeeeee" distance="10" alpha="0.75" quality="2" blurX="25" blurY="25"/>
			</filters>
		</RichText>
		<RichText x="738" y="255" width="438" height="85" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.9019607843137255">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="24" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">兽怪使用武器发射1-3枚弹射物，造成<span color="#b8b8b8">70%</span><span>伤害。「解放」状态下连发3发，造成对应元素的</span><span color="#ffff99">100%</span><span>伤害。</span></p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
		<RichText x="66" y="720" width="263" height="20" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.7490196078431373">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="16" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">兽怪可使用的武器为手弩和小型手<span fontFamily="HP Simplified Hans">砲</span><span>。</span></p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
		<RichText x="738" y="479" width="424" height="200" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.9019607843137255">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="24" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">兽怪将使用自身的元素力，令其进入「解放」状态，根据变体的不同，其可汲取<span color="#99ff87">草</span><span>/</span><span color="#99ffff">冰</span><span>/</span><span color="#7fffd7">风</span><span>的元素力，使攻击变为对应属性伤害。<br/>「解放」状态下会连续发射多枚弹药。受</span><span color="#bfdfff">「星烁反应」</span><span>影响，每进行一次攻击就会被打断。</span></p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
